import{_ as n,o as t,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 803 | Transcended Ones and Energy | Increment-Development Energy Creation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 803 | Transcended Ones and Energy | Increment-Development Energy Creation","no":803,"module":4,"tags":["Transcended One","Energy","Increment Development","Energy Creation","Anti-Predation"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","15-Energy-Cycle and Transformation Law","07-Self-Generated-Self-Grown Evolution Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0803_模块4-超脱者与能量-增量开发.md","filePath":"en/0803_模块4-超脱者与能量-增量开发.md"}'),r={name:"en/0803_模块4-超脱者与能量-增量开发.md"};function a(s,e,l,c,d,h){return t(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-803-transcended-ones-and-energy-increment-development-energy-creation" tabindex="-1">Entry 803 | Transcended Ones and Energy | Increment-Development Energy Creation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-803-transcended-ones-and-energy-increment-development-energy-creation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 803 | Transcended Ones and Energy | Increment-Development Energy Creation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 15, 07</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-true-energy-creation-is-not-creation-out-of-nothing-but-turning-entropy-reduction-into-productive-power" tabindex="-1">Introduction: true energy creation is not creation out of nothing, but turning entropy reduction into productive power <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-true-energy-creation-is-not-creation-out-of-nothing-but-turning-entropy-reduction-into-productive-power" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: true energy creation is not creation out of nothing, but turning entropy reduction into productive power&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The anti-predation axiom&#39;s first sentence is &quot;develop increment, do not consume stock.&quot; This sounds abstract at the cultivator level, but at the transcended-one level it must be converted into an operable engineering task: <strong>without predating any stock energy, how do we create net increment for the cosmos?</strong> This is &quot;increment-development energy creation&quot; — Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s orthodox answer to &quot;can the transcended one create energy.&quot;</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry are pushed to the hardest technical layer: the anti-predation axiom is increment development&#39;s legislative base; the republican axiom of Myriad Races is the distribution principle that increment results must be shared by Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom is increment development&#39;s ultimate goal — serving the cosmos&#39; overall uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom restrains the increment-development process from disturbing others&#39; causality; the law-first axiom ensures the definition of &quot;energy creation&quot; itself is strictly self-consistent, never secretly breaking energy conservation for plot convenience.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The core question this article answers: at the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, what energy does the transcended one actually &quot;create,&quot; and on what grounds is this not predation?</p><h2 id="i-energy-creation-s-precise-definition-not-creation-out-of-nothing-but-entropy-reduction-engineering" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy Creation&quot;&#39;s Precise Definition: Not Creation out of Nothing, but Entropy-Reduction Engineering <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-creation-s-precise-definition-not-creation-out-of-nothing-but-entropy-reduction-engineering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy Creation&quot;&#39;s Precise Definition: Not Creation out of Nothing, but Entropy-Reduction Engineering&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old system&#39;s handling of &quot;energy creation&quot; is very rough — protagonist aura lights up, energy emerges from nothing. This kind of writing is unacceptable book-eating under the law-first axiom. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s precise definition:</p><blockquote><p><strong>The transcended one&#39;s &quot;energy creation&quot; = through law-anchor authority, re-weaving energy that was originally dissipated into unusable background radiation due to entropy increase back into a benign cycle life may use.</strong></p></blockquote><p>This definition has three keywords:</p><ul><li><strong>&quot;Originally dissipated&quot;</strong>: this energy already physically exists, but was lost due to the cosmos&#39; disorder. The transcended one does not create energy from nothing, but recycles &quot;garbage&quot; into &quot;resources.&quot;</li><li><strong>&quot;Re-weaving&quot;</strong>: the weaving tool is law-anchor authority — the transcended one, by fine-tuning law parameters, moves energy from &quot;unusable state&quot; into &quot;usable state.&quot; This is technical work, not magic.</li><li><strong>&quot;Benign cycle&quot;</strong>: recycled energy is not hoarded in the transcended one&#39;s body, but immediately flows into the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle for Myriad Ranks to use.</li></ul><p>So, &quot;energy creation&quot;&#39;s essence is <strong>entropy-reduction engineering&#39;s industrialization</strong>. It does not violate energy conservation — total energy is unchanged; what changes is order. And order&#39;s rise is civilization&#39;s increment.</p><h2 id="ii-increment-development-s-three-technical-paths" tabindex="-1">II. Increment Development&#39;s Three Technical Paths <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-increment-development-s-three-technical-paths" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Increment Development&#39;s Three Technical Paths&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per the Self-Generated-Self-Grown Evolution Law (Document 07) and Energy-Cycle and Transformation Law (Document 15), the transcended one has three mature paths for increment development:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Path</th><th>Technical Principle</th><th>Increment Source</th><th>Typical Application</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Path 1: Loss recovery</td><td>Lower loss rate in cross-plane energy transmission and transformation</td><td>Energy originally wasted in transmission is recovered</td><td>Cross-plane channel efficiency optimization</td></tr><tr><td>Path 2: Purification efficiency gain</td><td>Raise transformation efficiency of life energy → law force → origin energy</td><td>Same input produces more high-purity energy</td><td>Cultivation-system optimization, Multiplication Fruit technology iteration</td></tr><tr><td>Path 3: New-circuit weaving</td><td>Open entirely new energy-cycle channels in the law network</td><td>Incorporate isolated energy blocks originally not participating in the cycle into the circuit</td><td>New-plane access, new-cosmic-structure development</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Three paths&#39; common point: <strong>increment comes from technical optimization and network expansion, not from taking from elsewhere.</strong> Path 1 saves what the cosmos itself wasted; Path 2 purifies what cultivators&#39; own purification labor paid; Path 3 connects in isolated energy originally there but unused. All three are increment, zero predation.</p><h2 id="iii-increment-development-and-predation-s-essential-distinction" tabindex="-1">III. Increment Development and Predation&#39;s Essential Distinction <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-increment-development-and-predation-s-essential-distinction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Increment Development and Predation&#39;s Essential Distinction&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Put increment development and predation side by side; the distinction is clear:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Predatory Cultivation</th><th>Increment Development</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Energy source</td><td>Take stock from elsewhere</td><td>Recover dissipation, optimize efficiency, expand circuits</td></tr><tr><td>Effect on cycle</td><td>Cut the cycle off, create more dissipation</td><td>Weave the cycle, reduce dissipation</td></tr><tr><td>Net effect</td><td>Predator +1, prey -2, cosmos net loss</td><td>Transcended one +1, Myriad Ranks +1, cosmos net increment</td></tr><tr><td>Sustainability</td><td>Unsustainable; one day no energy left to predate</td><td>Sustainable; technical efficiency may rise infinitely</td></tr><tr><td>Civilizational weight effect</td><td>Consensus negative, effective combat power negative</td><td>Consensus positive, effective combat power positive</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The key is the &quot;net effect&quot; row: predation is a negative-sum game; increment development is a positive-sum game. The transcended one transcends precisely because he chose the positive-sum game — the increment he makes makes every Myriad-Rank person richer, not poorer.</p><h2 id="iv-increment-development-s-approval-and-sharing-mechanism" tabindex="-1">IV. Increment Development&#39;s Approval and Sharing Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-increment-development-s-approval-and-sharing-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Increment Development&#39;s Approval and Sharing Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Increment development is not something the transcended one may do on a whim. Because it involves fine-tuning the law network, it must follow strict procedure:</p><ol><li><strong>Proposal</strong>: the transcended one proposes an increment-development plan, explaining technical path, projected increment, impact scope;</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank Republican Council review</strong>: assess the plan&#39;s impact on Myriad Ranks, confirm no predatory content;</li><li><strong>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision preplay</strong>: simulate and review the plan&#39;s post-operation energy impact in the Quest Sediment Domain;</li><li><strong>Pilot operation</strong>: first pilot in a small range, verifying increment is real and loss controllable;</li><li><strong>Full promotion</strong>: after the pilot passes, the plan goes public; technical details enter the Selfless Dao public library.</li></ol><p>The last step is critical: <strong>any increment-development technical result must be opened to Myriad Ranks.</strong> This is the republican axiom of Myriad Races&#39; direct requirement — increment comes from the Myriad-Rank cycle; increment&#39;s technology must also return to Myriad Ranks&#39; hands. Privately hoarding increment technology equals monopolizing civilizational progress; under Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law framework it is a felony.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: increment development&#39;s three paths all revolve around &quot;reduce loss, recycle waste,&quot; using every bit of cosmic energy to the fullest</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: by definition completely sever &quot;energy creation&quot; from &quot;predation&quot; — every bit of energy in increment development has a clean origin and public destination</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system, strong ones rely on &quot;star-absorbing art&quot; to predate stock and grow stronger; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended one relies on &quot;entropy-reduction engineering&quot; to create increment and grow stronger — the former sits on a shrinking mountain, the latter opens a flowing spring</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: increment-development results through the Selfless Dao public library open to all Myriad-Rank lineages; carbon-based, energy clans, mechanical clans, consciousness clans, mixed clans all benefit</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: increment-development technical paths, approval procedures, and simulation-review data are all public; any transcended one may reproduce, improve, and iterate</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Develop increment, do not consume stock&quot; is not a slogan, but an energy project the transcended one executes every day. He recycles what the cosmos wastes, purifies what life pays, weaves what exists in isolation — these three together are Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s orthodox definition of &quot;energy creation.&quot; This definition both holds energy conservation, fulfills the anti-predation axiom, and lets Myriad Ranks share technical results. The transcended one is a transcended one not because he can conjure energy, but because he can make the cosmos itself more efficient, more ordered, and richer.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">Entry 15 · Energy-Cycle and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/07-自生自长进化法则.html">Entry 07 · Self-Generated-Self-Grown Evolution Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/801_模块4-超脱者与能量-总论.html">Entry 801 · Transcended Ones and Energy Overview</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const m=n(r,[["render",a]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
